{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50370","headline":"敦煌（伯五○○七）三首 寿昌 · 敦煌人作品[一]","name":"敦煌（伯五○○七）三首 寿昌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"会稽碛畔亦疆场，迥出平田筑寿昌。\n沙幕雾深鸣□雁，草枯犹未及重阳。\n狐裘上（尚）冷搜红髓，絺葛那堪卧□霜。\n邹曾不行文墨少，移枫徒哭说西王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"敦煌人作品[一]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50370.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50370","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}